{"ok": true, "data": {"abstain": false, "abstain_reason": null, "summary": {"claims": 16, "supported": 16, "unsupported": 0, "citations": 16, "verified": 14, "weak": 2, "flagged": 0}, "claims": [{"text": "思维链提示通过让模型显式输出中间推理步骤，显著提升了大语言模型的复杂推理能力（Wei 等, 2022）。", "supported": true, "citations": [{"source": "s1", "url": null, "resolved_by": "id", "url_status": "known", "quote_status": "missing", "doi_status": "verified", "verdict": "weak", "ref": 1}]}, {"text": "自一致性在思维链基础上对多条推理路径做边际化投票，进一步提升复杂推理任务的准确率（Wang 等, 2022）。", "supported": true, "citations": [{"source": "s2", "url": null, "resolved_by": "id", "url_status": "known", "quote_status": "verified", "doi_status": "verified", "verdict": "verified", "ref": 2}]}, {"text": "GSM8K 基准表明，即便模型在许多任务上达到人类水平，其多步数学文字题推理仍不稳健（Cobbe 等, 2021）。", "supported": true, "citations": [{"source": "s3", "url": null, "resolved_by": "id", "url_status": "known", "quote_status": "verified", "doi_status": "verified", "verdict": "verified", "ref": 3}]}, {"text": "MATH 数据集的提出说明竞赛级数学解题能力仍显著超出当时计算机的能力边界（Hendrycks 等, 2021）。", "supported": true, "citations": [{"source": "s4", "url": null, "resolved_by": "id", "url_status": "known", "quote_status": "verified", "doi_status": "verified", "verdict": "verified", "ref": 4}]}, {"text": "PoT 将数值推理中的计算与推理解耦，把计算交给程序解释器执行（Chen 等, 2022）。", "supported": true, "citations": [{"source": "s5", "url": null, "resolved_by": "id", "url_status": "known", "quote_status": "verified", "doi_status": "verified", "verdict": "verified", "ref": 5}]}, {"text": "PAL 以生成程序作为推理载体，由运行时执行算术与符号运算（Gao 等, 2022）。", "supported": true, "citations": [{"source": "s6", "url": null, "resolved_by": "id", "url_status": "known", "quote_status": "verified", "doi_status": "verified", "verdict": "verified", "ref": 6}]}, {"text": "Toolformer 表明语言模型可在少量监督下自学调用外部工具（Schick 等, 2023）。", "supported": true, "citations": [{"source": "s7", "url": null, "resolved_by": "id", "url_status": "known", "quote_status": "verified", "doi_status": "verified", "verdict": "verified", "ref": 7}]}, {"text": "Lean 4 以 Lean 自身重实现定理证明器，兼具证明助手与通用编程语言属性（de Moura 与 Ullrich, 2021）。", "supported": true, "citations": [{"source": "s8", "url": null, "resolved_by": "id", "url_status": "known", "quote_status": "verified", "doi_status": "verified", "verdict": "verified", "ref": 8}]}, {"text": "LeanDojo 面向 Lean 形式定理证明，提供可检索增强的交互式训练与评测环境（Yang 等, 2023）。", "supported": true, "citations": [{"source": "s9", "url": null, "resolved_by": "id", "url_status": "known", "quote_status": "verified", "doi_status": "verified", "verdict": "verified", "ref": 9}]}, {"text": "Z3 是被广泛使用的 SMT 求解器，为形式验证提供可判定内核（de Moura 与 Bjørner, 2008）。", "supported": true, "citations": [{"source": "s10", "url": null, "resolved_by": "id", "url_status": "known", "quote_status": "missing", "doi_status": "verified", "verdict": "weak", "ref": 10}]}, {"text": "Logic-LM 通过把自然语言问题转译为符号求解器输入，提升逻辑推理的忠实性（Pan 等, 2023）。", "supported": true, "citations": [{"source": "s11", "url": null, "resolved_by": "id", "url_status": "known", "quote_status": "verified", "doi_status": "verified", "verdict": "verified", "ref": 11}]}, {"text": "LLaMA 提供 7B 至 65B 参数规模的开源基础模型系列（Touvron 等, 2023）。", "supported": true, "citations": [{"source": "s12", "url": null, "resolved_by": "id", "url_status": "known", "quote_status": "verified", "doi_status": "verified", "verdict": "verified", "ref": 12}]}, {"text": "过程监督（逐步验证）在数学推理上优于仅监督最终答案的结果监督（Lightman 等, 2023）。", "supported": true, "citations": [{"source": "s13", "url": null, "resolved_by": "id", "url_status": "known", "quote_status": "verified", "doi_status": "verified", "verdict": "verified", "ref": 13}]}, {"text": "自动形式化指把自然语言数学自动翻译为形式规范与证明（Wu 等, 2022）。", "supported": true, "citations": [{"source": "s14", "url": null, "resolved_by": "id", "url_status": "known", "quote_status": "verified", "doi_status": "verified", "verdict": "verified", "ref": 14}]}, {"text": "神经符号人工智能综述系统梳理了学习与推理的融合路线（Marra 等, 2024）。", "supported": true, "citations": [{"source": "s15", "url": null, "resolved_by": "id", "url_status": "known", "quote_status": "verified", "doi_status": "verified", "verdict": "verified", "ref": 15}]}, {"text": "在基于 Curry-Howard 对应的编程与证明系统中，命题等式的处理是类型理论的核心设计问题（Altenkirch 等, 2007）。", "supported": true, "citations": [{"source": "s16", "url": null, "resolved_by": "id", "url_status": "known", "quote_status": "verified", "doi_status": "verified", "verdict": "verified", "ref": 16}]}], "references": [{"ref": 1, "title": "Chain-Of-Thought Prompting Elicits Reasoning in Large Language Models", "url": "https://openalex.org/W7133224126", "date": "2022-01-01"}, {"ref": 2, "title": "Self-Consistency Improves Chain of Thought Reasoning in Language Models", "url": "https://openalex.org/W4221161695", "date": "2022-03-21"}, {"ref": 3, "title": "Training Verifiers to Solve Math Word Problems", "url": "https://openalex.org/W3210904070", "date": "2021-10-27"}, {"ref": 4, "title": "Measuring Mathematical Problem Solving With the MATH Dataset", "url": "https://openalex.org/W3134642945", "date": "2021-03-05"}, {"ref": 5, "title": "Program of Thoughts Prompting: Disentangling Computation from Reasoning for Numerical Reasoning Tasks", "url": "https://openalex.org/W4309953112", "date": "2022-11-22"}, {"ref": 6, "title": "PAL: Program-aided Language Models", "url": "https://openalex.org/W4309591663", "date": "2022-11-18"}, {"ref": 7, "title": "Toolformer: Language Models Can Teach Themselves to Use Tools", "url": "https://openalex.org/W4320165837", "date": "2023-02-09"}, {"ref": 8, "title": "The Lean 4 Theorem Prover and Programming Language", "url": "https://openalex.org/W3178506813", "date": "2021-01-01"}, {"ref": 9, "title": "LeanDojo: Theorem Proving with Retrieval-Augmented Language Models", "url": "https://openalex.org/W4382498654", "date": "2023-06-27"}, {"ref": 10, "title": "Z3: An Efficient SMT Solver", "url": "https://openalex.org/W1480909796", "date": "2008-01-01"}, {"ref": 11, "title": "Logic-LM: Empowering Large Language Models with Symbolic Solvers for Faithful Logical Reasoning", "url": "https://openalex.org/W4389519818", "date": "2023-01-01"}, {"ref": 12, "title": "LLaMA: Open and Efficient Foundation Language Models", "url": "https://openalex.org/W4322718191", "date": "2023-02-27"}, {"ref": 13, "title": "Let's Verify Step by Step", "url": "https://openalex.org/W4379089709", "date": "2023-05-31"}, {"ref": 14, "title": "Autoformalization with Large Language Models", "url": "https://openalex.org/W4282045675", "date": "2022-05-25"}, {"ref": 15, "title": "From statistical relational to neurosymbolic artificial intelligence: A survey", "url": "https://openalex.org/W4391493576", "date": "2024-01-09"}, {"ref": 16, "title": "Observational equality, now!", "url": "https://openalex.org/W2133629640", "date": "2007-10-02"}], "flags": []}}